{"id":53160,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/bocal-trail-run\/"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:23:37","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:23:37","slug":"bocal-trail-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/bocal-trail-run\/","title":{"rendered":"Bocal Trail Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Bocal Trail Run 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Bocal Trail Run 2026<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u2013 BTR II) realiza-se no dia <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), com partida e chegada no <strong>Campo Santo do ACD Bocal<\/strong>, na localidade do Bocal, concelho de <strong>Mafra<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>). Com abertura do secretariado \u00e0s 07:00 e controlo zero \u00e0s 08:30, a partida conjunta est\u00e1 agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong>, tendo um limite global de 500 participantes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos percorrem os vales, linhas de \u00e1gua, caminhos rurais e trilhos florestais da regi\u00e3o saloia do concelho de <strong>Mafra<\/strong>, combinando sec\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00e9cnicas de terra batida, pedra, ra\u00edzes e vegeta\u00e7\u00e3o densa. O programa integra o <strong>Trail Longo de 26 km<\/strong> (<strong>1100m D+<\/strong>, pontu\u00e1vel para o Circuito de Trail Longo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa), o <strong>Trail Curto de 18 km<\/strong> (<strong>850m D+<\/strong>, pontu\u00e1vel para o Circuito de Trail Sprint da AAL) e o <strong>Mini Trail \/ Caminhada de 13 km<\/strong> (<strong>550m D+<\/strong>), todos com tempo limite de 6 horas.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Planeado e organizado pela <strong>MSTT Trail Team Associa\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> (MSTT), o evento garante dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica para as tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a <em>finisher<\/em>, seguro desportivo e banhos no final da prova. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 10