e=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 31\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 15\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Bocal Trail Run 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Bocal Trail Run 2026 realiza-se no dia 22 de novembro de 2026 (domingo), no Campo Santo do ACD Bocal, em Mafra. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00, o controlo zero decorre \u00e0s 08:30 e a partida das provas \u00e9 dada \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os desn\u00edveis acumulados do BTR II?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 composto por tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias com tempo limite global de 6 horas: Trail Longo de 26 km (cerca de 1100m D+), Trail Curto de 18 km (cerca de 850m D+) e Mini Trail \/ Caminhada de 13 km (cerca de 550m D+).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Bocal Trail Run 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em tr\u00eas fases: at\u00e9 31 de agosto (16 \u20ac nos 26 km, 14 \u20ac nos 18 km e 12 \u20ac nos 13 km), de 1 de setembro a 31 de outubro (19 \u20ac nos 26 km, 17 \u20ac nos 18 km e 15 \u20ac nos 13 km) e de 1 a 15 de novembro (24 \u20ac nos 26 km, 22 \u20ac nos 18 km e 20 \u20ac nos 13 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos participantes?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No Trail Longo (26 km) e no Trail Curto (18 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta t\u00e9rmica, recipiente com \u00e1gua e apito. No Mini Trail \/ Caminhada (13 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o dorsal vis\u00edvel e telem\u00f3vel operacional. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos nos abastecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Bocal Trail Run 2026 e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela MSTT Trail Team Associa\u00e7\u00e3o, pontuando para os Circuitos de Trail Longo e Trail Sprint da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher, seguro desportivo e banhos finais.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Bocal Trail Run 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Mafra, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mafra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Bocal Trail Run 2026 (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se a 22 de novembro no Bocal, Mafra. Provas de 26 km, 18 km e Mini Trail\/Caminhada de 13 km. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/bocal-trail-run-2026.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 26 km\", \"price\": \"19.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/2-Bocal-Trail-Run\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 18 km\", \"price\": \"17.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/2-Bocal-Trail-Run\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Trail \/ Caminhada 13 km\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/2-Bocal-Trail-Run\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Bocal Trail Run 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Bocal Trail Run 2026 realiza-se no dia 22 de novembro de 2026 (domingo), no Campo Santo do ACD Bocal, em Mafra. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00, o controlo zero decorre \u00e0s 08:30 e a partida das provas \u00e9 dada \u00e0s 09:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os desn\u00edveis acumulados do BTR II?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 composto por tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias com tempo limite global de 6 horas: Trail Longo de 26 km (cerca de 1100m D+), Trail Curto de 18 km (cerca de 850m D+) e Mini Trail \/ Caminhada de 13 km (cerca de 550m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Bocal Trail Run 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em tr\u00eas fases: at\u00e9 31 de agosto (16 \u20ac nos 26 km, 14 \u20ac nos 18 km e 12 \u20ac nos 13 km), de 1 de setembro a 31 de outubro (19 \u20ac nos 26 km, 17 \u20ac nos 18 km e 15 \u20ac nos 13 km) e de 1 a 15 de novembro (24 \u20ac nos 26 km, 22 \u20ac nos 18 km e 20 \u20ac nos 13 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos participantes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No Trail Longo (26 km) e no Trail Curto (18 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta t\u00e9rmica, recipiente com \u00e1gua e apito. No Mini Trail \/ Caminhada (13 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o dorsal vis\u00edvel e telem\u00f3vel operacional. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos nos abastecimentos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o Bocal Trail Run 2026 e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela MSTT Trail Team Associa\u00e7\u00e3o, pontuando para os Circuitos de Trail Longo e Trail Sprint da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher, seguro desportivo e banhos finais.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66315,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-53160","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mafra-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/bocal-trail-run-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/53160","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/